VERDICT (against the pre-registered criteria):
  Neither the primary member (misses by a factor 861) nor the closest member (2.2% off) clears the bar. Even the most generous reading (the closest member alone, N=1, predicted precision set equal to its own 2.19% miss, which is not a-priori) gives P = 1.09e-3, just above the 1e-3 threshold, and the model's real a-priori precision is O(1).
  The model reaches the target in NO reading. The O(1)-to-fourth-power structure means the nearest member is a near coincidence of the kind lane D's bar is built to discount (it reproduces 4 Z^2, the part of the old formula that lane D scored as chance).
